@startuml digitization-search-sequence
title Luồng Upload → Số hoá → Xem/Duyệt → Embed/Index → Search\n(1 API Service + 1 AI Service - AI Service đảm nhận số hoá, embed, rerank, và xử lý search)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam BoxPadding 10
autonumber

actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "API Service\n(Spring Boot)" as API
queue "RabbitMQ\n(exchange ai.jobs)" as MQ
participant "AI Service\n(số hoá OCR/STT/SED\n+ embed + rerank + search)" as AI
database "Object Storage\n(SeaweedFS S3)" as S3
database "PostgreSQL\n(nguồn sự thật)" as PG
database "OpenSearch\n(document-v1 / segment-v1)" as OS
database "Qdrant\n(segment-vec-v1)" as QD

== 1. Upload tài liệu ==

User -> API: POST /documents (file)
activate API
API -> S3: PUT object (storage_key)
API -> PG: INSERT document\n(id, original_name, mime_type, size,\nsha256, storage_key, folder_id, status)
API -> PG: INSERT digitization_source\n(component_type, file_path, mime_type,\ndispatchable, dispatch_status='pending')
note right of PG
  Cùng 1 transaction Postgres:
  INSERT outbox_event
  (event_type='document.ingested',
   payload={documentId,...})
end note
API -> PG: INSERT outbox_event('document.ingested')
API -> MQ: publish job (routing key q.ocr | q.stt | q.video\ntheo mime_type; DigitizationDispatchService)
API --> User: 201 Created (document đã nạp kho,\nchờ xử lý số hoá)
deactivate API

note over API, OS
  **Bất đồng bộ, song song với luồng chính:**
  SearchIndexOutboxPoller (poll mỗi 2s) đọc outbox_event
  'document.ingested' → upsert document + segment
  content_source='title' vào OpenSearch ngay
  (tài liệu tìm được theo TÊN dù OCR/STT chưa xong)
end note
API -> OS: (job nền) upsert document-v1 + segment title

== 2. Số hoá (AI Service tiêu thụ hàng đợi) ==

MQ -> AI: consume job (q.ocr/q.stt/q.sed/q.video)
activate AI
AI -> S3: GET source file (file_path)
AI -> AI: chạy model offline (PaddleOCR/VietOCR,\nPhoWhisper STT, SED...) trên GPU nội bộ
AI -> S3: PUT derived/<document_id>/<run_id>.json\n(raw_output_path)
AI -> MQ: publish heartbeat định kỳ (q.heartbeat)
MQ -> API: DigitizationHeartbeatConsumer
API -> PG: UPDATE digitization_run.lease_expires_at
AI -> MQ: publish kết quả (q.result) khi xong
deactivate AI
MQ -> API: DigitizationResultConsumer
activate API
API -> PG: UPDATE digitization_run\n(processing_status='succeeded', model_name/version,\nmetrics, raw_output_path, review_state='pending')
API -> PG: INSERT content_segment[]\n(ai_text=current_text, page_no/bbox hoặc\ntime_start_ms/time_end_ms, confidence)
API -> PG: UPSERT document_digitization_status\n(<task>_status='pending_review')
deactivate API

== 3. Người dùng xem & sửa (trước khi duyệt) ==

User -> API: GET /review/runs/{runId}
activate API
API -> PG: SELECT digitization_run, content_segment\nWHERE run_id=...
API -> S3: GET file gốc → render ảnh trang (PDFBox,\nkhông cache, mỗi request)
API --> User: segment[] + ảnh trang/mốc thời gian
deactivate API

opt Cán bộ sửa nội dung OCR/STT
  User -> API: PUT /review/segments/{id} (text mới)
  activate API
  API -> PG: INSERT segment_revision (revision_no, text, edited_by)
  API -> PG: UPDATE content_segment\n(current_text, current_revision_no, is_edited=true)
  API --> User: 200 OK
  deactivate API
end

== 4. Duyệt (FR-18) ==

User -> API: POST /review/runs/{runId}/confirm
activate API
note right of PG
  Cùng 1 transaction:
  - UPDATE digitization_run (review_state='confirmed',
    confirm_source, confirmed_by/at)
  - supersede run cũ cùng (document,task) nếu có
  - UPSERT document_digitization_status(<task>_status='confirmed')
  - INSERT outbox_event('review.confirmed',
    {documentId, runId, task})
  - INSERT audit_log('digitization_review.confirmed')
end note
API -> PG: transaction ở trên (atomic)
API --> User: 200 OK
deactivate API

== 5. Đồng bộ chỉ mục toàn văn + Embed vector (bất đồng bộ) ==

loop mỗi app.search-index.poll-interval-ms (mặc định 2000ms)
  API -> PG: claim outbox_event chưa xử lý\n(event_type='review.confirmed'/'reconfirmed')
  activate API
  API -> PG: SELECT content_segment WHERE run_id=...\nAND NOT deleted
  API -> OS: bulk upsert segment-v1 (text=current_text,\nvị trí, ACL scope_group_ids/owner_user_id)
  API -> OS: upsert document-v1 (nếu chưa có)
  API -> PG: UPDATE outbox_event.processed_at=now()\n(lỗi → giữ NULL, tăng attempts, retry)
  deactivate API
end

note over AI, QD
  **[Thiết kế search-semantic.md - Draft, chưa triển khai]**
  Embed segment để phục vụ tìm kiếm ngữ nghĩa (FR-24)
end note
API -> AI: yêu cầu embed segment vừa duyệt\n(segment_id, current_text, model_version)
activate AI
AI -> AI: TEI embed (bge-m3, 1024 chiều, cosine)
AI -> QD: upsert point(id=segment_id, vector,\npayload={document_id, owner_user_id,\nscope_group_ids, acl_version, model_version})
AI --> API: ack
deactivate AI

== 6. Search ==

User -> API: POST /search {query, filters, sort}
activate API
API -> API: dựng scopeCtx (groupIds(user) từ Redis,\nfail-closed nếu thiếu) + ScopeFilterBuilder

alt Toàn văn (FR-22/23, đã triển khai)
  API -> OS: lexicalSearch(query, filters+ACL,\nfrom/size, highlight)
  OS --> API: hits (BM25 score, highlight offset)
  API -> PG: hydrate (SELECT document/content_segment\nby segment_id) + double-check ACL (row-level)
  API --> User: SearchResponse (results, totalApprox,\ndegraded_mode, refineSuggestions)

else Ngữ nghĩa/Hybrid (FR-24, Draft - forward sang AI Service)
  API -> AI: forward search request\n(query, filters, scopeCtx)
  activate AI
  AI -> AI: embed câu hỏi (TEI bge-m3)
  par Truy vấn song song
    AI -> OS: lexicalSearch(query, filters+ACL, top_k=50)
    OS --> AI: 50 candidates (BM25)
  else
    AI -> QD: vector search(embedding,\nfilter pre-filter ACL+filters, top_k=50)
    QD --> AI: 50 candidates (cosine)
  end
  AI -> AI: hợp nhất RRF (k=60) trên segment_id
  AI -> AI: rerank top 20 (cross-encoder\nbge-reranker-v2-m3)
  AI -> AI: lọc theo semantic.min_score (0.35 sau sigmoid)
  AI --> API: ranked segment_id[] + rerank_score
  deactivate AI
  API -> PG: hydrate nội dung thật (current_text, vị trí,\nmetadata) + double-check ACL quyết định
  API --> User: kết quả kèm dẫn nguồn (citation),\nhoặc "không đủ căn cứ" nếu rỗng sau lọc
end
deactivate API

@enduml
